# A package-local ignore REPLACES stow's built-in defaults (it doesn't
# extend them), so reproduce the defaults here and append our own.
# Patterns are Perl regexes matched against basename or full path.
#
# Note: this pkg is NOT meant to be stowed into $HOME — install.sh links
# everything into ~/Documents/Obsidian/.../ instead. The ignore list
# makes `stow obsidian` a safe no-op (nothing leaks to $HOME) for anyone
# who runs it by reflex.

# --- stow built-in defaults (2.4.x) ---
RCS
.+,v
CVS
\.\#.+
\.cvsignore
\.svn
_darcs
\.hg
\.git.*
\.gitignore
\.bzr.*
.+\.bak
.+\.swp
\.DS_Store
\._.+
LICENSE.*
COPYING.*
README.*

# --- package-specific: nothing in this pkg goes to $HOME via stow ---
^/install\.sh$
^/CHEATSHEET\.txt$
^/sky-paper\.css$
^/vimrc$
^/hotkeys\.json$
